text = "DEAD BLOCK: SURVIVAL

Inspired by the survival loop of classic top-down zombie arena shooters.

Engine: Godot 4.7 Standard (Compatibility GLES3 Renderer)
Platform Target: Android Mobile & Desktop Testing

Typography:
- Bebas Neue by Ryoichi Tsunekawa (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
- Special Elite by Astigmatic (Apache License 2.0)

All scene architectures, UI layouts, and GDScripts are original project assets.
Full attribution tracked in docs/CREDITS.md."
autowrap_mode = 3

